* cell_t2.scs — symmetric T-type 2 dB ATT cell, sky130 switches + IDEAL R/C
* IN -Rs1- MID -Rs2- OUT; M1 bypass across IN-OUT (gate=SWB, ON in the
* reference state); MID shunt arm Rp||Cp then M2 to GND (gate=SW, ON in the
* attenuation state).
* Sizing (T formulas, Ron1 direct input 8 ohm): A'=2.430 dB (IL_ref from M1),
*   Rs=6.95 ohm/arm, Rp=148.17 ohm. M1: w=92.5 nf=46 (Ron ~ 8 ohm);
*   M2: w=26.2 nf=13 (Ron ~ 28.2 ohm). Cp scan optimum 40 fF.
.subckt att_t2 in out sw swb
Rs1 in mid 6.95
Rs2 mid out 6.95
Rp  mid n2 148.17
Cp  mid n2 40e-15
XM1 out gb in 0 sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.15 w=92.5 nf=46
XM2 n2  gs 0  0 sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.15 w=26.2 nf=13
Rg1 gb swb 10k
Rg2 gs sw 10k
.ends
